l":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110263.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-05T13:37:22Z"},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110262\r\n\r\nTo ensure Android exports are compatible with the new Play Store requirement that all `.so` libraries included are aligned to 16k, we now require C# projects to target `net9.0` which uses the correct alignment (as opposed to the current one of 4k).\r\n- Upstream PR: https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/pull/104577\r\n\r\nThe thirdparty jar library has also been updated to the one from the [9.0.4](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime.Mono.android-arm64/9.0.4) runtime package so it's compatible with non-gradle builds targeting `net9.0`.\r\n\r\nNon-android projects are not affect, the minimum TFM is still `net8.0`.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110263/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/